## What this licence does NOT cover

**This licence covers this playbook's own content only.**

The playbook studies and describes roughly 107 external projects. It does not
redistribute them, and it does not relicense them. Each remains under its own
terms, which are recorded per-source in [`sources.yml`](sources.yml) and
summarised in [`NOTICE.md`](NOTICE.md). Some are copyleft, and some are not open
source at all — see NOTICE.md before copying anything from a source this playbook
cites.

Game assets, engine SDKs, proprietary binaries and the contents of any local
`External/` or reference-checkout directory are **not** part of this repository
and are not covered here.

The observations, measurements and techniques described in this playbook are
statements of fact about how software behaves. Describing behaviour is not
redistribution of the software described.
